<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Cockerill has Internet site.</title>
<headline>Belgian Cockerill has Internet site.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian steel maker Cockerill Sambre SA said on Tuesday that from November 18 it has a presence on the Internet offering company information.</p>
<p>The address is www.cockerillsambregroup.com.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
